<title>SINGAPORE: Esso Singapore declines comment over refining cut.</title>
<headline>Esso Singapore declines comment over refining cut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Esso Singapore spokeswoman said on Wednesday the company would not make any comment about refinery runs after a source close to the company said on Tuesday output had been cut 10 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Officially, we decline to make any commnet,&quot; the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The source on Tuesday said the 230,000 barrels-per-day refinery had cut runs because of weak refining margins.</p>
<p>Traders said other refiners were watching margins closely to determine if they also needed to cut runs.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3080)</p>
</text>
